{"unit_id":"CAI-MH__dsh-quality-review#card-zh","repo":"CAI-MH/dsh-quality-review","commit":"7c5a67ddc76e91d2a87725fabb23a04b80370f3b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-quality-review 是一个接入 DSH 的回答质量审核插件，在助手每轮即将结束时读取用户提问和助手可见回复，并调用宿主提供的 LLM 服务进行独立审核。它检查事实准确性、回答完整性、逻辑一致性和指令遵循，也可按匹配的 SOP 文件增加任务标准审核；发现明确问题时会向 agent 提交修订要求，并以轮数上限避免持续追问。它适合希望在对话中自动复核回答质量、让 agent 按具体反馈完善结果的 DSH 用户。可配置审核模型路由，也可将本地 SOP 文件放入指定目录；审核模型默认沿用 agent 的 provider 和 model。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:167-255","src/reviewer.ts:185-210"]}
{"unit_id":"CAI-MH__dsh-quality-review#card-en","repo":"CAI-MH/dsh-quality-review","commit":"7c5a67ddc76e91d2a87725fabb23a04b80370f3b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-quality-review reviews each DSH reply before a turn closes, checking accuracy, completeness, logic, and instruction following through the host LLM. It can apply local SOP standards and steer targeted revisions, with a limit on review rounds.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:167-255","src/reviewer.ts:185-210"]}
