{"unit_id":"CAI-MH__dsh-quality-review#feature-1","repo":"CAI-MH/dsh-quality-review","commit":"7c5a67ddc76e91d2a87725fabb23a04b80370f3b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-quality-review 的功能「回答多维度审核」：在助手回合即将结束时，把用户问题和可见回复交给审核模型，按启用的事实准确性、完整性、逻辑一致性及指令遵循维度检查。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:177-231","src/reviewer.ts:76-85"]}
{"unit_id":"CAI-MH__dsh-quality-review#feature-2","repo":"CAI-MH/dsh-quality-review","commit":"7c5a67ddc76e91d2a87725fabb23a04b80370f3b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-quality-review 的功能「审核失败后引导修订」：审核模型指出可操作的问题时，插件将问题和修改建议作为消息交给 agent，让它直接提交修正后的完整回答；每轮修订次数受 maxRounds 限制。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:239-255","src/reviewer.ts:214-226"]}
{"unit_id":"CAI-MH__dsh-quality-review#feature-3","repo":"CAI-MH/dsh-quality-review","commit":"7c5a67ddc76e91d2a87725fabb23a04b80370f3b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-quality-review 的功能「按 SOP 标准审核」：用户提问匹配 SOP 文件名时，插件把目录中的标准文件内容加入审核提示，额外检查任务标准；目录会在每轮重新扫描。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:198-215","src/sop.ts:28-60"]}
{"unit_id":"CAI-MH__dsh-quality-review#feature-4","repo":"CAI-MH/dsh-quality-review","commit":"7c5a67ddc76e91d2a87725fabb23a04b80370f3b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-quality-review 的功能「豁免关键词与短回复跳过」：可配置关键词匹配以跳过审核；首次审核还会略过低于 minReplyChars 的短回复。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:145-153","src/index.ts:189-196"]}
